{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S01\",\"screen\":\"我到底在气谁 又在想谁\",\"source\":\"心里明明有东西，却还分不清这份不平静究竟是愤怒、遗憾还是怀念——这是一种尚未找到对象、也尚未找到语言的失落。\",\"type\":\"5\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿强调情绪尚未找到对象，屏幕稿却补出了一个可被指向的“谁”，把无对象的失落具体化成了对某个人的情绪。\"},{\"sec\":\"S06\",\"screen\":\"压在心底的委屈终于冒了头\",\"source\":\"那些压住的愿望、委屈和思念，终于有机会浮现。\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿说的是终于有机会浮现，屏幕稿则写成委屈已经冒头，把可能性变成了已经发生的事实。\"},{\"sec\":\"S10\",\"screen\":\"开头的试探又把问题递回来：我究竟要怎样继续生活\",\"source\":\"如果把这次回返听成心理上的回望，开头的试探姿态仿佛把问题重新递回来：“那么，我究竟要怎样继续生活？”\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"删去了“如果……听成”和“仿佛”的限定，把一种可选的心理听法写成了确定的表达。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "581e5472-a1ef-4659-92bc-2bfe8328b7a4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261109T034158404809Z", "elapsed_seconds": 116.875, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T03:43:55.298709+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2cbc6ba24a0b8402939c23024a9a1165ba9211d08adee94cbb918a241373896c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4